===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:enformacioun|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|enformacioun}}, {{m|enm|informacioun}}, borrowed from {{der|en|xno|informacioun}}, {{m|en|enformation}}, {{der|en|fro|information}}, from {{der|en|la|īnfōrmātiō||formation, conception; education}}, from the participle stem of {{m|la|īnformāre||to inform}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|inform|ation}}.

